              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Shamsh Kassim-Lakha was invited to deliver a 15-minute talk on Science Education, Peace and Development. Other speakers included Dr. Kausar A. Malik on biotechnology, Dr. Hameed A. Khan, Executive Director, Commission on Science and Technology for Sustainable Development in the South (COMSATS) on the Power of IT and Dr. Iftikhar Ahmad, Deputy DG, National Agriculture Research Centre (NARC) on Agriculture Development.",
